<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 15-18.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 15-18.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Friday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for August 15-18. The kroon is</p>
<p>pegged at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	    August 15-18    August 14/15</p>
<p>    CZK     0.43337	   0.43462</p>
<p>    DKK     210098.	   2.10067</p>
<p>    FIM     2.66652	   2.67231</p>
<p>    GBP    23.50014	  23.15425</p>
<p>    HUF     0.07446	   0.07434</p>
<p>    LTL     3.68803	   3.66321</p>
<p>    LVL    25.17914	  25.07607</p>
<p>    RUR     0.00254	   0.00252</p>
<p>    SEK     1.83675	   1.83632</p>
<p>    UAH     7.96501	   7.91081</p>
<p>    USD    14.7512	   14.6532</p>
<p>    XEU    15.73584	  15.71922</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
